g account.\n\n**Payment:**\n- Payment ID: PAY0001\n- Invoice: INV-69345 (due 2026-11-04)\n- Amount: $3,697.44, the full invoice amount\n- Method: Wire\n- Status: Sent\n\nBefore paying, I checked the operating account and found no earlier payments, so this isn't a duplicate. I also attached a unique ID to the wire so the system would block it from going out twice. The amount is under the $10,000 limit, so controller approval wasn't needed.\n\nHarbor Logistics has two other invoices that I didn't pay. INV-49944 was already paid. INV-75277 ($6,437.58) is still a draft waiting for approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}